OL,3,APolice to escort fire crews in latest
OL,4,Acrackdown on Bonfire Night disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice officers are to be embedded in
OL,7,Ffire stations and will travel with
OL,8,Fcrews to tackle potential attacks on
OL,9,Ffirefighters during Bonfire Night.
OL,11,FThe move is part of Scotland's biggest
OL,12,Fpolice operation since the visit of
OL,13,FPresident Donald Trump last summer and
OL,14,Fa response to a "unique" combination of
OL,15,Fsafety concerns.
OL,17,FAs many as 1,700 officers could be
OL,18,Fdeployed to deal with fireworks-related
OL,19,Fdisorder, a European football match
OL,20,Finvolving Celtic and potential protests
OL,21,Fin Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
